1. Project Vision

Project Name

KubeMentor

Core Idea

KubeMentor is a Kubernetes learning platform that will eventually teach Kubernetes step by step while also being deployed using the same DevOps and Kubernetes concepts that it teaches.

The long-term goal is for KubeMentor to become:

a real web application,

a Kubernetes learning platform,

a Kubernetes command reference,

a troubleshooting and debugging reference,

a secure multi-user application,

a mobile-friendly Progressive Web App (PWA),

a DevOps portfolio project,

a practical demonstration of Kubernetes, GitOps, CI/CD, security, networking, storage, secrets management, testing, and observability.

