9. Current Git Strategy

Current development branch:

feature/flask-foundation

The Flask foundation remains on this branch until the feature is complete.

Do not create a separate fix/ branch for bugs found during active feature development.

Example:

feature/flask-foundation
   ├── add Flask app
   ├── add /health
   ├── add /ready
   ├── add tests
   ├── find bug
   ├── fix bug
   └── complete feature

A fix/ or hotfix/ branch is more appropriate when repairing already-integrated stable code.

